      "description": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>In life: a polished royal courtier with an oiled moustache, a green-and-gold sash and a confident diplomat's smile. In death: the same face on a stake, with a crow perched on the pole.</p>\n<section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-iRGEhFYM1nPwI4b7\">\n<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.wdlbFe4qIZDYqrwL]{03. Nine Mouths, One Belly}.</strong> The King's envoy, eaten mid-negotiation. His head sits on a stake beside the barrow; his satchel holds the King's letter of offer, 400 gp and a greater bottled lightning.</p>\n</section>",
